{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 77,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the choirmaster. According to Jeduthun. A Psalm of Asaph. I cried out to God; I cried aloud to God to hear me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the day of trouble I sought the Lord; through the night my outstretched hands did not grow weary; my soul refused to be comforted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I remembered You, O God, and I groaned; I mused and my spirit grew faint. Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You have kept my eyes from closing; I am too troubled to speak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I considered the days of old, the years long in the past.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "At night I remembered my song; in my heart I mused, and my spirit pondered:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "“Will the Lord spurn us forever and never show His favor again?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is His loving devotion gone forever? Has His promise failed for all time?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Has God forgotten to be gracious? Has His anger shut off His compassion?” Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So I said, “I am grieved that the right hand of the Most High has changed.”",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will remember the works of the LORD; yes, I will remember Your wonders of old.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will reflect on all You have done and ponder Your mighty deeds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your way, O God, is holy. What god is so great as our God?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You are the God who works wonders; You display Your strength among the peoples.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With power You redeemed Your people, the sons of Jacob and Joseph. Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The waters saw You, O God; the waters saw You and swirled; even the depths were shaken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The clouds poured down water; the skies resounded with thunder; Your arrows flashed back and forth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your thunder resounded in the whirlwind; the lightning lit up the world; the earth trembled and quaked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your path led through the sea, Your way through the mighty waters, but Your footprints were not to be found.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.77.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.77.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You led Your people like a flock by the hand of Moses and Aaron.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
